From: Project SunUEFI
Subject: [PATCH] power: add optional device-specific ambient-light policy

GNOME 48.1. Raw SensorProxy lux remains unchanged. A matching DT
compatible and measured lux unit select a profile; other devices keep
existing behavior. Piano uses the actual OS3.0.309.0 main-ALS 15/19/15
threshold points and 1000/1000/5000ms continuous intervals. Relative changes
follow the stock lux-to-nits curve and KTZ8866 exponential current mapping,
anchored to the user's brightness. Keep sensor data and GNOME smoothing.

